    "slug": "echo-of-the-lost-world",
    "description": "<p>The user is a vestige of a long-forgotten time - when nature was more fierce and survival more uncertain. As such, the user is naturally hardier and stronger than initally expected.</p><p>The user may learn any one move from the @Trait[fossil] Tutor List, and may learn two other Moves from any of their Tutor Lists, up to their Grade.</p><p>The user's Stats are increased, based on how close each of their Base Stats are to 100 if not @Trait[fully-evolved] and 130 if they are @Trait[fully-evolved), with this amount doubled if the user has Fossilized slotted.</p>",
